  "finding": "the skill LISTING is silently truncated. Six fixtures each planting 24,000 UTF-16 units of descriptions at six entry widths are all cut, at a whole-entry boundary, with whole skills simply absent from the prompt and NO notice of any kind -- unlike the auto-memory index, which at least prints a warning. The same 60 skills arrive whole at 3,600 units, so it is size and not count.",
